        "custom_liquid_mnWCT9": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  KOSMETIKAL — Cele trei butoane + calculatorul de volum\n\n  Bloc \"Custom Liquid\" în secțiunea Product information, imediat sub blocul \"Buy buttons\".\n  ⚠️ „Show dynamic checkout buttons\" (Buy with Shop) trebuie oprit din blocul Buy buttons.\n\n  Calculatorul citește scara de praguri din:\n    metafield de produs `custom.price_tiers`  →  setarea globală „Volume discount scale\"\n  Format, un prag pe linie:  cantitate = reducere%   (ex. „240 = 16\")\n  Pragurile sub minim sau peste plafon se ignoră; fiecare se rotunjește la multiplul de bax.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign m = product.metafields.custom -%}\n\n{%- assign kk_moq  = m.moq.value | default: settings.kk_moq | default: 10 -%}\n{%- assign kk_cap  = m.max_qty.value | default: settings.kk_cap | default: 500 -%}\n{%- assign kk_mult = m.case_multiple.value | default: settings.kk_case_multiple | default: 1 -%}\n{%- assign kk_mult = kk_mult | plus: 0 -%}\n{%- if kk_mult < 1 -%}{%- assign kk_mult = 1 -%}{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- assign kk_cases = kk_moq | divided_by: kk_mult -%}\n{%- assign kk_exact = kk_cases | times: kk_mult -%}\n{%- if kk_exact < kk_moq -%}{%- assign kk_cases = kk_cases | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}\n{%- assign kk_casemin = kk_cases | times: kk_mult -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Ca în panou: cu „Allow single-piece orders\" pornit, minimul devine 1, dar\n  sliderul rămâne pe grila baxului — o singură bucată se atinge tastând, nu trăgând.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- if settings.kk_allow_single -%}\n  {%- assign kk_min = 1 -%}\n{%- else -%}\n  {%- assign kk_min = kk_casemin -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Ultima treaptă validă sub plafon. Sliderul din panou trece dincolo de plafon,\n  ca să se poată ajunge la ofertă; cel de aici nu, fiindcă peste plafon\n  calculatorul se ascunde și controlul ar dispărea de sub deget în timpul tragerii.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign kk_span    = kk_cap | minus: kk_casemin -%}\n{%- assign kk_steps   = kk_span | divided_by: kk_mult -%}\n{%- assign kk_capstep = kk_steps | times: kk_mult | plus: kk_casemin -%}\n\n{%- assign kk_retail = settings.kk_retail_multiplier | default: 3.5 -%}\n{%- assign kk_scale  = m.price_tiers.value | default: settings.kk_price_tiers -%}\n\n{%- assign kk_lead_on    = settings.kk_lead_enabled -%}\n{%- assign kk_lead_phone = settings.kk_lead_phone -%}\n{%- assign kk_lead_title = settings.kk_lead_title | default: 'Before you upload your design' -%}\n{%- assign kk_lead_body  = settings.kk_lead_body  | default: 'Every design is reviewed by our team before it goes into production. Leave your details so we can reach you if anything needs adjusting.' -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Studioul de etichetă apare doar la produsele care AU etichetă, adică cele cu\n  dimensiuni definite. Fără ele nu știm ce desenăm, așa că rămâne doar upload-ul.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign kk_lw = m.label_width_mm.value  | default: settings.kk_label_w -%}\n{%- assign kk_lh = m.label_height_mm.value | default: settings.kk_label_h -%}\n{%- assign kk_studio = false -%}\n{%- if kk_lw > 0 and kk_lh > 0 -%}{%- assign kk_studio = true -%}{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Eticheta desfășurată are trei zone, ca la orice ambalaj cilindric:\n  FAȚĂ (unde desenează clientul) · CENTRU (cotorul, unde se suprapune) · SPATE\n  (panoul legal). Lățimile din dreapta se scad din total; ce rămâne e fața.\n  Cu spate = 0, eticheta e dintr-o bucată și se comportă ca înainte.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign kk_lback   = m.label_back_mm.value   | default: settings.kk_label_back   | default: 0 -%}\n{%- assign kk_lcenter = m.label_center_mm.value | default: settings.kk_label_center | default: 0 -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Panoul legal, cerut de Reg. (UE) 1223/2009 art. 19. Ce avem în metacâmpuri se\n  completează; ce lipsește rămâne marcat între paranteze drepte, DINADINS — golurile\n  trebuie să se vadă pe ecran, nu să fie ascunse până la tipar.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign kk_vol = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.title -%}\n{%- capture kk_legal -%}\n{{ product.title }}\n{{ kk_vol }} e\n\nINGREDIENTS\n{{ m.inci.value | default: '[INCI — to be supplied]' }}\n\nPeriod after opening: [to be supplied]\nPrecautions: [to be supplied]\n\nResponsible Person\n[name and address — to be decided]\n\nBatch: [assigned at production]\nMADE IN ITALY\n{%- endcapture -%}\n\n<div class=\"kk-cta\" data-kk-cta\n     data-kk-retail=\"{{ kk_retail }}\"\n     data-kk-min=\"{{ kk_min }}\"\n     data-kk-cap=\"{{ kk_cap }}\"\n     data-kk-mult=\"{{ kk_mult }}\">\n\n  <script type=\"application/json\" data-kk-scale>{{ kk_scale | json }}</script>\n\n  <div class=\"kk-cta-row\">\n    <a class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--ghost\" href=\"/pages/contact\">Order sample</a>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--solid\" data-kk-design-toggle>\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z\"/><path d=\"M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z\"/>\n      </svg>\n      Add design\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--wide\" data-kk-calc-toggle>\n    Bulk &amp; profit calculator\n  </button>\n\n  <a class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--solid kk-btn--wide\" href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" data-kk-quote hidden>\n    Request a quote\n  </a>\n\n  <div class=\"kk-drawer\" data-kk-design hidden>\n    {%- if kk_studio -%}\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--solid kk-btn--wide kk-studio-go\" data-kk-studio-open>\n        Design your label here\n      </button>\n      <p class=\"kk-hint kk-hint--ok\" data-kk-studio-note hidden></p>\n      <p class=\"kk-or\"><span>or upload a ready file</span></p>\n    {%- endif -%}\n\n    <label class=\"kk-drawer-lab\" for=\"kk-file\">Upload your logo or label</label>\n    <input type=\"file\" id=\"kk-file\" name=\"properties[Design]\"\n           accept=\".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.pdf,.ai,.eps,.svg\" data-kk-file>\n    <p class=\"kk-hint\">PNG, JPG, PDF, AI, EPS or SVG &middot; max 20&nbsp;MB</p>\n    <p class=\"kk-hint kk-hint--ok\" data-kk-ok hidden>\n      &check; Attached. Your design is reviewed and confirmed before production.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  {%- comment -%}\n    Fără slider propriu: calculatorul urmează cantitatea din panoul B2B.\n    Un singur control conduce și totalul, și profitul. Scara de praguri e navigabilă.\n  {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"kk-drawer kk-calc\" data-kk-calc hidden>\n\n    <div class=\"kk-calc-head\">\n      <span class=\"kk-calc-qty\"><b data-kk-cq></b> pcs</span>\n      <span class=\"kk-calc-off\" data-kk-coff></span>\n    </div>\n\n    {%- comment -%}\n      Poartă același `data-kk-range` ca sliderul din panou, deci panoul îl conduce\n      și îl sincronizează fără cod suplimentar aici. Rostul lui e să ai cantitatea\n      la îndemână chiar lângă cifre, fără să dai scroll înapoi în sus.\n    {%- endcomment -%}\n    <input type=\"range\" class=\"kk-range kk-calc-range\" data-kk-range\n           min=\"{{ kk_casemin }}\" max=\"{{ kk_capstep }}\" step=\"{{ kk_mult }}\" value=\"{{ kk_casemin }}\"\n           aria-label=\"Quantity\">\n\n    <dl class=\"kk-figs\">\n      <div><dt>Your cost / pc</dt><dd data-kk-cost></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>You save</dt><dd data-kk-save></dd></div>\n      <div class=\"kk-figs-sep\">\n        <dt><label for=\"kk-retail-in\">Your retail / pc</label></dt>\n        <dd class=\"kk-retail-cell\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&euro;</span>\n          <input id=\"kk-retail-in\" class=\"kk-retail-in\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\"\n                 data-kk-retail-in aria-label=\"Your retail price per piece\">\n        </dd>\n      </div>\n      <div><dt>Your revenue</dt><dd data-kk-rev></dd></div>\n      <div class=\"kk-figs-hero\"><dt>Your profit</dt><dd data-kk-profit></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Your margin</dt><dd data-kk-margin></dd></div>\n    </dl>\n\n    <p class=\"kk-hint\">Retail price is our suggestion &mdash; type yours over it to see your own margin.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"kk-ladder-lab\">Volume scale &mdash; tap a row to jump</p>\n    <table class=\"kk-ladder\"><tbody data-kk-ladder></tbody></table>\n\n    <p class=\"kk-hint\">Indicative figures. Final pricing is confirmed with your order.</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Popup de lead capture, la intrarea în zona de design.\n\n  Din ședință: „colectezi emailul, telefonul când intră în studio\", plus observația\n  lui Claudio că „90% din oameni o să se blocheze în proces\" — fără contact, un\n  abandon e pierdut definitiv, iar fără eveniment nu știi unde se rupe fluxul.\n\n  Stă în AFARA blocului .kk-cta dinadins: .kk-cta e mutat în formularul de produs,\n  iar un <form> în alt <form> e HTML invalid și browserul îl rupe. La încărcare,\n  JS-ul îl mută în <body>, ca să stea deasupra headerului lipicios al temei.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- if kk_lead_on -%}\n  <div class=\"kk-lead\" data-kk-lead hidden>\n    <div class=\"kk-lead-veil\" data-kk-lead-close></div>\n\n    <div class=\"kk-lead-box\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"kk-lead-h\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-lead-x\" data-kk-lead-close aria-label=\"Close\">&times;</button>\n\n      <h2 class=\"kk-lead-h\" id=\"kk-lead-h\">{{ kk_lead_title }}</h2>\n      <p class=\"kk-lead-p\">{{ kk_lead_body }}</p>\n\n      {%- form 'contact', id: 'KkLead', class: 'kk-lead-form' -%}\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[Enquiry]\" value=\"Design started\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[Product]\" value=\"{{ product.title | escape }}\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[Quantity]\" value=\"\" data-kk-lead-qty>\n\n        <label class=\"kk-lead-lab\" for=\"kk-lead-email\">Email</label>\n        <input class=\"kk-lead-in\" id=\"kk-lead-email\" type=\"email\" name=\"contact[email]\"\n               autocomplete=\"email\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" required\n               data-kk-lead-email>\n\n        <label class=\"kk-lead-lab\" for=\"kk-lead-tel\">Phone{%- unless kk_lead_phone %} <span class=\"kk-lead-opt\">(optional)</span>{% endunless -%}</label>\n        <input class=\"kk-lead-in\" id=\"kk-lead-tel\" type=\"tel\" name=\"contact[Phone]\"\n               autocomplete=\"tel\"{% if kk_lead_phone %} required{% endif %}\n               data-kk-lead-tel>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--solid kk-btn--wide\">Continue to design</button>\n\n        <p class=\"kk-hint kk-lead-err\" data-kk-lead-err hidden></p>\n        <p class=\"kk-hint\">We use this only to contact you about this order.</p>\n      {%- endform -%}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Studioul de etichetă. Codul stă în fișiere de temă, nu aici — sunt câteva sute\n  de linii și se editează mult mai ușor din repo decât dintr-un bloc Custom Liquid.\n  Fabric.js se încarcă abia la prima deschidere, din kk-label-studio.js.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- if kk_studio -%}\n  {{ 'kk-label-studio.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n  <script src=\"{{ 'kk-label-studio.js' | asset_url }}\" defer></script>\n\n  <div class=\"kk-studio\" data-kk-studio hidden\n       data-kk-fabric=\"{{ 'kk-fabric.min.js' | asset_url }}\"\n       data-kk-lw=\"{{ kk_lw }}\"\n       data-kk-lh=\"{{ kk_lh }}\"\n       data-kk-back=\"{{ kk_lback }}\"\n       data-kk-center=\"{{ kk_lcenter }}\"\n       data-kk-legal=\"{{ kk_legal | strip | escape }}\"\n       data-kk-name=\"{{ product.title | escape }}\">\n\n    <div class=\"kk-studio-bar\">\n      <h2 class=\"kk-studio-title\">Label studio</h2>\n      <span class=\"kk-studio-dims\">{{ kk_lw }} &times; {{ kk_lh }} mm</span>\n      <label class=\"kk-guides-toggle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked data-kk-guides-toggle>\n        <span>Guides</span>\n      </label>\n\n      <span class=\"kk-zoom\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-zoom-btn\" data-kk-zoom=\"-\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\">&minus;</button>\n        <span class=\"kk-zoom-val\" data-kk-zoom-val>100%</span>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-zoom-btn\" data-kk-zoom=\"+\" aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-zoom-btn kk-zoom-fit\" data-kk-zoom=\"fit\">Fit</button>\n      </span>\n\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--bar\" data-kk-studio-download>Download</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--bar kk-btn--solid\" data-kk-studio-done>Use this design</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-studio-x\" data-kk-studio-close aria-label=\"Close studio\">&times;</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"kk-studio-main\">\n      <div class=\"kk-studio-stage\">\n        <div class=\"kk-studio-frame\">\n          <canvas data-kk-canvas></canvas>\n          <div class=\"kk-studio-guides\" data-kk-guides></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <aside class=\"kk-studio-side\">\n        {%- comment -%}\n          Valorile reale ale produsului, ca butoane de inserare. Clientul nu-și\n          bate capul să transcrie INCI-ul sau volumul — dă click și apare corect.\n          Se trimit ca JSON ca să nu hardcodăm lista în JS: ce nu e completat\n          pe produs nu apare deloc.\n        {%- endcomment -%}\n        <script type=\"application/json\" data-kk-fields>\n          {\n            \"Brand name\": {{ 'Your brand' | json }},\n            \"Product title\": {{ product.title | json }}\n            {%- if kk_vol != blank -%}, \"Volume\": {{ kk_vol | json }}{%- endif -%}\n            {%- if m.inci.value != blank -%}, \"INCI\": {{ m.inci.value | json }}{%- endif -%}\n            {%- if m.active_ingredients.value != blank -%}, \"Key ingredients\": {{ m.active_ingredients.value | join: ', ' | json }}{%- endif -%}\n            {%- if m.claims.value != blank -%}, \"Claims\": {{ m.claims.value | join: ' · ' | json }}{%- endif -%}\n            {%- if m.recommended_for.value != blank -%}, \"Skin type\": {{ m.recommended_for.value | join: ', ' | json }}{%- endif -%}\n            {%- if m.skin_concerns.value != blank -%}, \"Concerns\": {{ m.skin_concerns.value | join: ', ' | json }}{%- endif -%}\n            {%- if m.how_to_use.value != blank -%}, \"How to use\": {{ m.how_to_use.value | json }}{%- endif -%}\n          }\n        </script>\n\n        <div class=\"kk-tool\">\n          <span class=\"kk-tool-lab\">Product info</span>\n          <div class=\"kk-chips\" data-kk-fieldlist></div>\n          <p class=\"kk-tool-hint\">\n            Click to drop the real value onto the label. You can still edit it afterwards.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"kk-tool\">\n          <span class=\"kk-tool-lab\">Shapes</span>\n          <div class=\"kk-shapes\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-shape\" data-kk-shape=\"rect\" aria-label=\"Square\"></button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-shape kk-shape--circle\" data-kk-shape=\"circle\" aria-label=\"Circle\"></button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-shape kk-shape--tri\" data-kk-shape=\"triangle\" aria-label=\"Triangle\"></button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-shape kk-shape--line\" data-kk-shape=\"line\" aria-label=\"Line\"></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"kk-tool\">\n          <span class=\"kk-tool-lab\">Label background</span>\n          <div class=\"kk-swatches\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-swatch\" data-kk-swatch=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background:#ffffff\" aria-label=\"White\"></button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-swatch\" data-kk-swatch=\"#f4f1ea\" style=\"background:#f4f1ea\" aria-label=\"Cream\"></button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-swatch\" data-kk-swatch=\"#e8e2d5\" style=\"background:#e8e2d5\" aria-label=\"Sand\"></button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-swatch\" data-kk-swatch=\"#c8d5c4\" style=\"background:#c8d5c4\" aria-label=\"Sage\"></button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-swatch\" data-kk-swatch=\"#1d1d1b\" style=\"background:#1d1d1b\" aria-label=\"Black\"></button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kk-field\">\n            <span>Custom</span>\n            <input type=\"color\" value=\"#ffffff\" data-kk-bg aria-label=\"Background colour\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"kk-tool\">\n          <span class=\"kk-tool-lab\">Add</span>\n          <label class=\"kk-tool-btn\" for=\"kk-studio-img\">\n            Add a logo or image\n            <input class=\"kk-tool-file\" type=\"file\" id=\"kk-studio-img\"\n                   accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/svg+xml\" data-kk-add-image>\n          </label>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-tool-btn\" data-kk-add-text>Add text</button>\n          <p class=\"kk-tool-hint\">\n            Drag to move, corner handles to resize and rotate. Keep anything important\n            inside the dashed line &mdash; that margin can be trimmed during printing.\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"kk-tool-hint kk-tool-warn\" data-kk-lowres hidden></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"kk-tool\" data-kk-selected hidden>\n          <span class=\"kk-tool-lab\">Selected item</span>\n          <div class=\"kk-field\" data-kk-text-only hidden>\n            <span>Font</span>\n            <select data-kk-font aria-label=\"Font\">\n              <option value=\"Helvetica\">Helvetica</option>\n              <option value=\"Georgia\">Georgia</option>\n              <option value=\"Times New Roman\">Times</option>\n              <option value=\"Courier New\">Courier</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kk-field\" data-kk-text-only hidden>\n            <span>Size</span>\n            <input type=\"range\" min=\"8\" max=\"140\" data-kk-size aria-label=\"Text size\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kk-field\" data-kk-text-only hidden>\n            <span>Colour</span>\n            <input type=\"color\" data-kk-color aria-label=\"Text colour\">\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-tool-btn kk-tool-btn--danger\" data-kk-del>Remove selected</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"kk-tool\">\n          <span class=\"kk-tool-lab\">Layers</span>\n          <ul class=\"kk-layers\" data-kk-layers></ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"kk-tool\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-tool-btn\" data-kk-reset>Start over</button>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n\n    {%- comment -%}\n      Bara de jos rămâne doar pentru ecrane mici, unde cea de sus n-are loc\n      pentru toate acțiunile.\n    {%- endcomment -%}\n    <div class=\"kk-studio-foot\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn\" data-kk-studio-close>Cancel</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"kk-btn kk-btn--solid\" data-kk-studio-done>Use this design</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n{%- endif -%}\n\n<style>\n  .kk-cta { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; }\n  .kk-cta-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }\n\n  /* `.kk-btn { display: inline-flex }` bate atributul `hidden`, care e o regulă de browser\n     cu prioritate minimă. Fără linia asta, butoanele „ascunse\" rămân vizibile. */\n  .kk-cta [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n  .kk-btn {\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .8rem;\n    padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem; font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: .04em;\n    text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n    background: none; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); text-align: center;\n  }\n  .kk-btn--solid { background: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); color: rgb(var(--color-background)); }\n  .kk-btn--ghost { background: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .06); border-color: transparent; }\n  .kk-btn--wide { width: 100%; margin-top: 1rem; }\n  .kk-btn:hover { opacity: .85; }\n\n  .kk-drawer {\n    margin-top: 1.4rem; padding: 1.8rem;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .18);\n  }\n  .kk-drawer-lab { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; }\n  .kk-drawer input[type=\"file\"] { width: 100%; font-size: 1.3rem; }\n  .kk-hint { margin: 1rem 0 0; font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: .6; }\n  .kk-hint--ok { opacity: 1; font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* --- calculator --- */\n  .kk-calc-head {\n    display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;\n  }\n  .kk-calc-qty { font-size: 1.3rem; opacity: .7; }\n  .kk-calc-qty b { font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 400; opacity: 1; }\n  .kk-calc-off {\n    font-size: 1.3rem; padding: .3rem 1rem;\n    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); color: rgb(var(--color-background));\n  }\n  .kk-calc-off:empty { display: none; }\n\n  /* .kk-range e stilat în blocul panoului; cele două sunt oricum inseparabile */\n  .kk-calc-range { margin: 0 0 1.8rem; }\n\n  .kk-ladder-lab {\n    margin: 2.4rem 0 .8rem; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .5;\n  }\n  .kk-ladder { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 1.3rem; }\n  .kk-ladder td { padding: .8rem .4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .08); }\n  .kk-ladder td:nth-child(2) { text-align: center; opacity: .6; }\n  .kk-ladder td:last-child { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .kk-ladder tr { cursor: pointer; }\n  .kk-ladder tr:hover td { background: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .04); }\n  .kk-ladder tr[data-on] td { font-weight: 600; background: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .07); }\n  .kk-ladder tr[data-on] td:nth-child(2) { opacity: 1; }\n\n  .kk-figs { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4rem; }\n  .kk-figs > div {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;\n    padding: .7rem 0;\n  }\n  .kk-figs dt { opacity: .65; }\n  .kk-figs dd { margin: 0; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .kk-figs-sep { border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .12); margin-top: .6rem; padding-top: 1.3rem !important; }\n  .kk-figs-hero dt { opacity: 1; font-weight: 600; }\n  .kk-figs-hero dd { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* Prețul de raft e câmp, nu text: specificația cere ca re-vânzătorul\n     să-și scrie propriul preț și să-și vadă marja. */\n  .kk-retail-cell { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .2rem; }\n  .kk-retail-in {\n    width: 7rem; padding: 0; text-align: right;\n    font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit; color: inherit;\n    background: none; border: 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(var(--color-foreground), .45);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  .kk-retail-in:focus { outline: none; border-bottom-style: solid; }\n\n  /* intrarea în studio, în capul sertarului de design */\n  .kk-studio-go { margin-top: 0; }\n  .kk-or {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem;\n    margin: 1.8rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: .55;\n  }\n  .kk-or::before, .kk-or::after {\n    content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px;\n    background: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .18);\n  }\n\n  /* --- popup de lead capture --- */\n  .kk-lead[hidden] { display: none; }\n  .kk-lead {\n    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 100;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    padding: 2rem;\n  }\n  .kk-lead-veil { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .55); }\n  .kk-lead-box {\n    position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 42rem;\n    max-height: calc(100vh - 4rem); overflow-y: auto;\n    padding: 3.2rem;\n    background: rgb(var(--color-background)); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n    box-shadow: 0 2rem 6rem rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);\n  }\n  .kk-lead-x {\n    position: absolute; top: .8rem; right: 1.2rem;\n    padding: .4rem 1rem; font-size: 2.4rem; line-height: 1;\n    background: none; border: 0; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; opacity: .5;\n  }\n  .kk-lead-x:hover { opacity: 1; }\n  .kk-lead-h { margin: 0 0 1.2rem; font-size: 2.2rem; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .kk-lead-p { margin: 0 0 2.4rem; font-size: 1.4rem; opacity: .75; }\n\n  .kk-lead-lab {\n    display: block; margin-bottom: .6rem;\n    font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .65;\n  }\n  .kk-lead-opt { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; opacity: .8; }\n  .kk-lead-in {\n    width: 100%; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;\n    font-size: 1.5rem; font-family: inherit;\n    background: none; color: inherit;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .25);\n  }\n  .kk-lead-in:focus { outline: none; border-color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); }\n  .kk-lead-in[aria-invalid=\"true\"] { border-color: #c0392b; }\n  .kk-lead-err { color: #c0392b; opacity: 1; }\n  .kk-lead-form .kk-btn--wide { margin-top: .6rem; }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .kk-lead-box { padding: 2.4rem 2rem; }\n    .kk-cta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .kk-figs { font-size: 1.3rem; }\n    .kk-ladder { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  /* Dawn re-randează coloana de produs; nimic nu se salvează în variabile,\n     totul se re-verifică periodic, listenerele sunt delegate pe document. */\n\n  var lastKey = null;\n\n  /* Prețul de raft tastat de cumpărător. `null` = n-a scris nimic, urmăm sugestia.\n     Stă în closure, deci supraviețuiește re-randărilor lui Dawn la schimbarea variantei. */\n  var retailOverride = null;\n\n  function cta()  { return document.querySelector('[data-kk-cta]'); }\n  function file() { return document.querySelector('[data-kk-file]'); }\n  function money(c) { return '€' + (c / 100).toFixed(2).replace('.', ','); }\n  function money0(c) { return '€' + Math.round(c / 100).toLocaleString('de-DE'); }\n\n  function productForm() {\n    var fs = document.querySelectorAll('form[action*=\"/cart/add\"]');\n    for (var i = 0; i < fs.length; i++) {\n      if (fs[i].querySelector('[name=\"add\"]')) return fs[i];\n    }\n    return fs[0] || null;\n  }\n\n  function ensurePlacement() {\n    var c = cta(), f = productForm();\n    if (!c || !f) return;\n    f.setAttribute('enctype', 'multipart/form-data');\n    if (c.parentElement === f) return;\n    var anchor = f.querySelector('[name=\"add\"]');\n    while (anchor && anchor.parentElement !== f) anchor = anchor.parentElement;\n    if (anchor) f.insertBefore(c, anchor); else f.appendChild(c);\n  }\n\n  function unitCents() {\n    var el = document.querySelector('[data-kk-unit]');\n    if (!el) return 0;\n    var n = parseFloat(el.textContent.replace(/[^\\d,.]/g, '').replace(',', '.'));\n    return isNaN(n) ? 0 : Math.round(n * 100);\n  }\n\n  /* Scara de praguri: text „cantitate = reducere%\" pe linie.\n     Se rotunjește la multiplul de bax, se taie la [minim, plafon], se deduplică. */\n  function tiers() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return [];\n    var min  = parseInt(c.dataset.kkMin, 10);\n    var cap  = parseInt(c.dataset.kkCap, 10);\n    var mult = parseInt(c.dataset.kkMult, 10) || 1;\n\n    var raw = '';\n    try { raw = JSON.parse(c.querySelector('[data-kk-scale]').textContent) || ''; } catch (e) {}\n\n    var out = [];\n    raw.split('\\n').forEach(function (line) {\n      var m = line.match(/(\\d+)\\s*=\\s*(\\d+(?:[.,]\\d+)?)/);\n      if (!m) return;\n      var q = parseInt(m[1], 10);\n      var d = parseFloat(m[2].replace(',', '.'));\n      if (mult > 1) q = Math.ceil(q / mult) * mult;          // aliniere la bax\n      if (q < min || q > cap) return;\n      out.push({ q: q, off: d / 100 });\n    });\n\n    // Crescator dupa cantitate; la cantitati egale, discountul mare intai.\n    out.sort(function (a, b) { return a.q - b.q || b.off - a.off; });\n\n    // Doua trepte pot cadea pe aceeasi cantitate dupa alinierea la bax\n    // (12 si 24 devin amandoua 24 la bax de 24). O pastram pe cea avantajoasa.\n    out = out.filter(function (t, i, a) { return i === 0 || t.q !== a[i - 1].q; });\n\n    if (!out.length || out[0].q > min) out.unshift({ q: min, off: 0 });\n\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  function currentQty() {\n    var qi = document.querySelector('[data-kk-qty]');\n    var n = qi ? parseInt(qi.value, 10) : NaN;\n    return isNaN(n) ? 0 : n;\n  }\n\n  /* reducerea aplicabilă la o cantitate = ultimul prag atins */\n  function tierAt(qty, ts) {\n    var t = ts[0];\n    for (var i = 0; i < ts.length; i++) if (qty >= ts[i].q) t = ts[i];\n    return t;\n  }\n\n  function paint() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var base = unitCents(); if (!base) return;\n    var ts = tiers(); if (!ts.length) return;\n\n    var qty = currentQty(); if (!qty) return;\n    var t   = tierAt(qty, ts);\n\n    /* Prețul de raft e sugerat din multiplicator, dar rămâne al cumpărătorului:\n       specificația cere „scrie prețul tău de raft → vezi marja ta\". Cât timp\n       câmpul e gol urmează sugestia; din clipa în care scrie ceva, decide el.\n       Sugestia e aceeași la orice volum — marja crește din cost, nu din raft. */\n    var retailX   = parseFloat(c.dataset.kkRetail);\n    var suggested = Math.round(base * retailX / 100) * 100;\n    var retail    = retailOverride === null ? suggested : retailOverride;\n    /* Shopify trunchiază reducerea pe bucată, nu rotunjește prețul redus.\n       La 13,90 cu −12%: 1,668 devine 1,66, deci 12,24, nu 12,23. Calculăm la\n       fel, altfel pagina și coșul se despart cu un cent pe bucată. */\n    var cost      = base - Math.floor(base * t.off);\n    var revenue   = retail * qty;\n    var profit    = revenue - cost * qty;\n\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-cq]').textContent     = qty.toLocaleString('de-DE');\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-coff]').textContent   = t.off > 0 ? '−' + Math.round(t.off * 100) + '%' : '';\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-cost]').textContent   = money(cost);\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-save]').textContent   = t.off > 0 ? money0((base - cost) * qty) : '—';\n    /* Nu suprascriem câmpul cât timp e sub cursor — altfel nu se poate tasta. */\n    var rin = c.querySelector('[data-kk-retail-in]');\n    if (rin && document.activeElement !== rin) {\n      rin.value = (retail / 100).toFixed(2).replace('.', ',');\n    }\n\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-rev]').textContent    = money0(revenue);\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-profit]').textContent = money0(profit);\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-margin]').textContent =\n      revenue > 0 ? Math.round(profit / revenue * 100) + '%' : '—';\n\n    var rows = c.querySelectorAll('[data-kk-ladder] tr');\n    for (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {\n      if (parseInt(rows[i].dataset.q, 10) === t.q) rows[i].setAttribute('data-on', '');\n      else rows[i].removeAttribute('data-on');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function build() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var ts = tiers(); if (!ts.length) return;\n    var base = unitCents(); if (!base) return;\n\n    var key = ts.map(function (t) { return t.q + ':' + t.off; }).join(',') + '|' + base;\n    if (key !== lastKey) {\n      lastKey = key;\n      c.querySelector('[data-kk-ladder]').innerHTML = ts.map(function (t) {\n        var cost = Math.round(base * (1 - t.off));\n        return '<tr data-q=\"' + t.q + '\">'\n             + '<td>' + t.q.toLocaleString('de-DE') + ' pcs</td>'\n             + '<td>' + (t.off > 0 ? '−' + Math.round(t.off * 100) + '%' : '—') + '</td>'\n             + '<td>' + money(cost) + '</td></tr>';\n      }).join('');\n    }\n    paint();\n  }\n\n  /* --- lead capture --- */\n\n  var LEAD_KEY = 'kk_lead';\n\n  function leadBox() { return document.querySelector('[data-kk-lead]'); }\n\n  function leadSaved() {\n    try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(LEAD_KEY) || 'null'); }\n    catch (e) { return null; }\n  }\n\n  /* Dawn re-randează coloana de produs și ar recrea popupul acolo unde era.\n     Păstrăm exact unul, în <body>, ca să nu ajungă sub headerul lipicios. */\n  function normalizeLead() {\n    var all = document.querySelectorAll('[data-kk-lead]');\n    if (!all.length) return;\n    var keep = null;\n    for (var i = 0; i < all.length; i++) {\n      if (all[i].parentElement === document.body) { keep = all[i]; break; }\n    }\n    for (var j = 0; j < all.length; j++) {\n      if (all[j] === keep) continue;\n      if (keep) all[j].parentElement.removeChild(all[j]);\n      else { document.body.appendChild(all[j]); keep = all[j]; }\n    }\n  }\n\n  function track(name, extra) {\n    var data = { product: {{ product.title | json }}, quantity: currentQty() };\n    if (extra) { for (var k in extra) data[k] = extra[k]; }\n    try {\n      if (window.Shopify && Shopify.analytics && typeof Shopify.analytics.publish === 'function') {\n        Shopify.analytics.publish(name, data);\n      }\n    } catch (e) {}\n    if (window.console && console.debug) console.debug('[kk]', name, data);\n  }\n\n  /* Contactul călătorește cu comanda, ca să fie în admin lângă fișierul de design. */\n  function attachLeadToOrder(lead) {\n    var f = productForm();\n    if (!f || !lead) return;\n    var pairs = [['_Lead email', lead.email], ['_Lead phone', lead.phone]];\n    for (var i = 0; i < pairs.length; i++) {\n      if (!pairs[i][1]) continue;\n      var nm = 'properties[' + pairs[i][0] + ']';\n      var el = f.querySelector('input[name=\"' + nm + '\"]');\n      if (!el) {\n        el = document.createElement('input');\n        el.type = 'hidden'; el.name = nm;\n        f.appendChild(el);\n      }\n      el.value = pairs[i][1];\n    }\n  }\n\n  function openLead() {\n    var b = leadBox(); if (!b) return;\n    var q = b.querySelector('[data-kk-lead-qty]');\n    if (q) q.value = currentQty();\n    b.hidden = false;\n    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n    var em = b.querySelector('[data-kk-lead-email]');\n    if (em) setTimeout(function () { em.focus(); }, 50);\n  }\n\n  function closeLead() {\n    var b = leadBox(); if (!b) return;\n    b.hidden = true;\n    document.body.style.overflow = '';\n  }\n\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (e.target.closest('[data-kk-lead-close]')) closeLead();\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n    var b = leadBox();\n    if (e.key === 'Escape' && b && !b.hidden) closeLead();\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    var form = e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.kk-lead-form') : null;\n    if (!form) return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n\n    var email = form.querySelector('[data-kk-lead-email]');\n    var tel   = form.querySelector('[data-kk-lead-tel]');\n    var err   = form.querySelector('[data-kk-lead-err]');\n\n    err.hidden = true;\n    email.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');\n    tel.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');\n\n    function fail(msg, field) {\n      err.textContent = msg; err.hidden = false;\n      field.setAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');\n      field.focus();\n    }\n\n    if (!/^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test(email.value.trim())) {\n      return fail('Please enter a valid email address.', email);\n    }\n    if (tel.required && tel.value.replace(/\\D/g, '').length < 6) {\n      return fail('Please enter a phone number we can reach you on.', tel);\n    }\n\n    var lead = { email: email.value.trim(), phone: tel.value.trim(), at: Date.now() };\n\n    /* Trimiterea către magazin e best-effort. Dacă pică rețeaua, omul intră\n       oricum în design — nu blocăm o comandă pentru un formular de contact. */\n    try {\n      fetch(form.action || '/contact', {\n        method: 'POST',\n        body: new FormData(form),\n        headers: { Accept: 'text/html' }\n      })['catch'](function () {});\n    } catch (e2) {}\n\n    try { localStorage.setItem(LEAD_KEY, JSON.stringify(lead)); } catch (e3) {}\n\n    track('design_lead_captured');\n    attachLeadToOrder(lead);\n    closeLead();\n\n    var c = cta();\n    var d = c && c.querySelector('[data-kk-design]');\n    if (d) d.hidden = false;\n  });\n\n  /* --- interacțiune --- */\n\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    if (e.target.closest('[data-kk-design-toggle]')) {\n      var d = c.querySelector('[data-kk-design]');\n      /* Prima intrare în design cere contactul; după aceea, butonul doar comută. */\n      if (d.hidden && leadBox() && !leadSaved()) {\n        track('design_started');\n        openLead();\n        return;\n      }\n      if (d.hidden) track('design_started');\n      d.hidden = !d.hidden;\n    }\n    if (e.target.closest('[data-kk-calc-toggle]')) {\n      var k = c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc]'); k.hidden = !k.hidden;\n      if (!k.hidden) { lastKey = null; build(); }\n    }\n    /* click pe un rând din scară → mută cantitatea din panou acolo */\n    var row = e.target.closest('[data-kk-ladder] tr');\n    if (row) {\n      var qi = document.querySelector('[data-kk-qty]');\n      if (qi) {\n        qi.value = row.dataset.q;\n        qi.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true }));\n        qi.dispatchEvent(new Event('blur',  { bubbles: true }));\n      }\n    }\n  });\n\n  /* calculatorul urmează cantitatea din panou — un singur control conduce tot */\n  document.addEventListener('input', function (e) {\n    if (e.target.matches('[data-kk-qty], [data-kk-range]')) paint();\n\n    if (e.target.matches('[data-kk-retail-in]')) {\n      var raw = e.target.value.replace(/[^\\d,.]/g, '').replace(',', '.');\n      var n   = parseFloat(raw);\n      /* câmp golit → revine la sugestie, fără buton separat de resetare */\n      retailOverride = (raw === '' || isNaN(n)) ? null : Math.round(n * 100);\n      paint();\n    }\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('change', function (e) {\n    if (!e.target.matches('[data-kk-file]')) return;\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var has = e.target.files && e.target.files.length > 0;\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-ok]').hidden = !has;\n    if (has) track('design_uploaded');\n    var f = productForm();\n    var label = f && f.querySelector('[name=\"add\"] span');\n    if (label) label.textContent = has ? 'Add to cart with my design' : 'Add to cart';\n  });\n\n  /* API-ul AJAX de coș al Shopify NU acceptă fișiere. Cu design atașat, ocolim\n     handlerul lui Dawn și facem submit nativ. form.submit() nu declanșează\n     evenimentul \"submit\", deci Dawn nu intervine. */\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    if (!e.target.closest('[name=\"add\"]')) return;\n    var fl = file(), f = productForm();\n    if (fl && fl.files && fl.files.length > 0 && f) {\n      ensurePlacement();\n      e.preventDefault();\n      e.stopImmediatePropagation();\n      f.submit();\n    }\n  }, true);\n\n  /* Peste plafon: butoanele de comandă se ascund, rămâne o singură rută. */\n  function applyCap() {\n    var c = cta(); if (!c) return;\n    var p = document.querySelector('[data-kk-panel]');\n    var qIn = document.querySelector('[data-kk-qty]');\n    if (!p || !qIn) return;\n\n    var cap  = parseInt(p.dataset.kkCap, 10);\n    var qty  = parseInt(qIn.value, 10);\n    var over = !isNaN(qty) && qty > cap;\n\n    c.querySelector('.kk-cta-row').style.display = over ? 'none' : '';\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc-toggle]').style.display = over ? 'none' : '';\n    c.querySelector('[data-kk-quote]').hidden = !over;\n    if (over) {\n      c.querySelector('[data-kk-design]').hidden = true;\n      c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc]').hidden   = true;\n    }\n\n    var f = productForm();\n    var add = f && f.querySelector('[name=\"add\"]');\n    if (add) {\n      var wrap = add.closest('.product-form__buttons') || add.parentElement;\n      if (wrap) wrap.style.display = over ? 'none' : '';\n    }\n  }\n\n  setInterval(function () {\n    ensurePlacement();\n    normalizeLead();\n    attachLeadToOrder(leadSaved());\n    applyCap();\n    var c = cta();\n    var k = c && c.querySelector('[data-kk-calc]');\n    if (k && !k.hidden) build();     // prinde schimbarea de variantă\n  }, 200);\n\n  ensurePlacement();\n  normalizeLead();\n})();\n</script>\n"
          }
        },
