      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  KOSMETIKAL — Zona de consumator, sub produs (V1)\n\n  ATENȚIE: ăsta NU e bloc, e SECȚIUNE.\n  Theme Editor → Products → Default product → în lista din stânga, jos, \"Add section\"\n  → Custom Liquid → se mută sub secțiunea \"Product information\".\n\n  Randează datele din metafields. Câmpurile goale (INCI, How to use) se ascund singure,\n  deci pagina nu arată ciuntită până vin datele din PDF.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign m = product.metafields.custom -%}\n\n<div class=\"kk-consumer\">\n  <div class=\"page-width\">\n\n    <p class=\"kk-resell\">\n      This is the product page your customers will see when you resell it —\n      with your brand on it.\n    </p>\n\n    {%- if m.claims.value != blank -%}\n      <ul class=\"kk-chips\">\n        {%- for c in m.claims.value -%}<li>{{ c }}</li>{%- endfor -%}\n      </ul>\n    {%- endif -%}\n\n    <div class=\"kk-grid\">\n\n      {%- if m.active_ingredients.value != blank -%}\n        <div class=\"kk-block\">\n          <h3>Key active ingredients</h3>\n          <ul class=\"kk-list\">\n            {%- for a in m.active_ingredients.value -%}<li>{{ a }}</li>{%- endfor -%}\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      {%- endif -%}\n\n      <div class=\"kk-block\">\n        {%- if m.recommended_for.value != blank -%}\n          <h3>Recommended for</h3>\n          <p>{{ m.recommended_for.value }}</p>\n        {%- endif -%}\n\n        {%- if m.skin_concerns.value != blank -%}\n          <h3>Targets</h3>\n          <p>{% for s in m.skin_concerns.value %}{{ s }}{% unless forloop.last %} &middot; {% endunless %}{% endfor %}</p>\n        {%- endif -%}\n\n        {%- if m.how_to_use.value != blank -%}\n          <h3>How to use</h3>\n          <p>{{ m.how_to_use.value | newline_to_br }}</p>\n        {%- endif -%}\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    {%- if m.inci.value != blank -%}\n      <div class=\"kk-block kk-block--wide\">\n        <h3>Full ingredient list (INCI)</h3>\n        <p class=\"kk-inci\">{{ m.inci.value }}</p>\n      </div>\n    {%- endif -%}\n\n    {%- comment -%}\n      Certificările sunt la nivel de brand (identice la toate cele 28 de produse),\n      de aceea sunt scrise aici, nu ținute ca metafield repetat pe fiecare produs.\n      Când vin logo-urile de la Claudio, se înlocuiesc textele cu imagini.\n    {%- endcomment -%}\n    <div class=\"kk-certs\">\n      <h3>Certifications</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li><span>ISO 9001</span><small>RINA &middot; 36217/18/s</small></li>\n        <li><span>ISO 22716 &mdash; GMP</span><small>RINA &middot; cosm/18/27</small></li>\n        <li><span>ICEA COSMOS Organic</span></li>\n        <li><span>ICEA COSMOS Natural</span></li>\n        <li><span>ICEA Eco Bio Cosmesi</span></li>\n        <li><span>ICEA Vegan</span></li>\n        <li><span>AIAB Bio Eco Cosmesi</span><small>Federazione CISQ</small></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"kk-meta\">\n      {%- if m.article_number.value != blank -%}Art. {{ m.article_number.value }} &middot; {% endif -%}\n      {%- if m.dermatologically_tested.value -%}Dermatologically tested &middot; {% endif -%}\n      Made in Italy &middot; Free from parabens, SLS/SLES, paraffins, silicones, mineral oils, PEG and synthetic dyes\n    </p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .kk-consumer {\n    padding: 5rem 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.1);\n  }\n\n  .kk-resell {\n    margin: 0 0 3rem; padding-left: 1.4rem;\n    border-left: 3px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.35);\n    font-size: 1.4rem; font-style: italic; opacity: .75; max-width: 52rem;\n  }\n\n  .kk-chips { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .8rem; margin: 0 0 3.5rem; padding: 0; }\n  .kk-chips li {\n    padding: .5rem 1.2rem; font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: .04em;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.25); border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n\n  .kk-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; }\n\n  .kk-block h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 1.2rem; font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: .1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .6; font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .kk-block h3 + p, .kk-block h3 + ul { margin-top: 0; }\n  .kk-block h3 ~ h3 { margin-top: 3rem; }\n  .kk-block p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n  .kk-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  .kk-list li {\n    padding: .9rem 0; font-size: 1.6rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.08);\n  }\n  .kk-list li:first-child { padding-top: 0; }\n\n  .kk-block--wide { margin-top: 4rem; }\n  .kk-inci { font-size: 1.3rem !important; line-height: 1.7; opacity: .8; }\n\n  .kk-certs { margin-top: 4rem; padding-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.1); }\n  .kk-certs h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 1.4rem; font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: .1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .6; font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .kk-certs ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  .kk-certs li {\n    padding: .9rem 1.4rem; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.25);\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .2rem;\n  }\n  .kk-certs li span { font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: .03em; }\n  .kk-certs li small { font-size: 1rem; opacity: .55; letter-spacing: .03em; }\n\n  .kk-meta {\n    margin: 3rem 0 0; padding-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: .55;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.1);\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .kk-consumer { padding: 3.5rem 0; }\n    .kk-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }\n  }\n</style>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    }
  },
  "order": [
    "main",
    "custom_liquid_kkinfo",
    "disclosures",
    "related-products"
  ]
}
